    "Copy any IBAN: the app auto-tags it as \"IBAN\". Find it later under the IBAN filter without searching." : {
      "comment" : "Smart clipboard hint: IBAN auto-tag",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
