    "{담당자}님, 오늘 {고객사} 미팅 감사합니다.\n논의: {요약}\n다음 단계: {다음 단계} ({다음 일정})" : {
      "comment" : "Essential snippet body: meeting follow-up. Keep every {…} blank with its braces; translate only the words inside",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dobrý den, {kontakt}, děkuji za dnešní schůzku s firmou {klient}.\nProbráno: {shrnutí}\nDalší krok: {další krok} ({další termín})"
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
